0d78b6cdc12f703ed6f36d6914a79"}, "expected_failure": "called `Option::unwrap()` on a `None` value", "expected_failure_match": true, "failure": "rope_builder::tests::rope_builder_default_01 panicked: called `Option::unwrap()` on a `None` value", "fixed_commit": "dfcac8b19ee571a2a399e189c12b2a10663ce464", "fixed_tree": "093acd77bd0267cd97eb3bdc0c2f277993d90f73", "fixes": [{"commit": "dfcac8b19ee571a2a399e189c12b2a10663ce464", "parent": "2507cbff272cb1e692998bc7837bf3eb65dfb2f6"}], "patch": "patches/dfcac8b19ee571a2a399e189c12b2a10663ce464-1/20260924T003515Z-b49d70e4.patch", "provenance": "verbatim", "restored_source_matches": true, "runs": {"buggy": {"exit_code": 101, "log": "evidence/dfcac8b19ee571a2a399e189c12b2a10663ce464-1/20260924T003515Z-b49d70e4/buggy.log", "named_result": "FAILED", "tests_run": 1, "timed_out": false}, "fixed": {"exit_code": 0, "log": "evidence/dfcac8b19ee571a2a399e189c12b2a10663ce464-1/20260924T003515Z-b49d70e4/fixed.log", "named_result": "ok", "tests_run": 1, "timed_out": false}, "restored": {"exit_code": 0, "log": "evidence/dfcac8b19ee571a2a399e189c12b2a10663ce464-1/20260924T003515Z-b49d70e4/restored.log", "named_result": "ok", "tests_run": 1, "timed_out": false}}, "signature": "called `Option::unwrap()` on a `None` value", "test_sources": [{"commit": "dfcac8b19ee571a2a399e189c12b2a10663ce464", "paths": ["src/rope_builder.rs"]}], "tests": ["rope_builder::tests::rope_builder_default_01"]}, "shard": "ropey", "status": "confirmed", "subject": "Fix broken Default impl for RopeBuilder.", "summary": "The derived Default implementation initializes RopeBuilder with an empty stack. Appending a leaf then panics at self.stack.pop().unwrap(), and finishing an empty builder can underflow the stack index. The fix implements Default through Self::new(), which initializes the required empty leaf. The regression test added by this commit builds a rope using RopeBuilder::default() and checks its contents and invariants. The proposed verbatim reversal restores the derive and removes the manual Default implementation while preserving the test. No builds or tests were run.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T00:37:56.379804+00:00"}
